  "rationale": "5 members; attendees {u1,u2,u3,u4}; u5 is not attending yet submitted a veto on m1. Phase 1 over attendees only: m1 rows u1..u4 all yes -> attendee_votes 4, coverage 4/4 = 1.00, yes 4, approval 1.00; m2 yes 3 / approval 0.75; m3 yes 2 / approval 0.50. All three promoted. u5's veto is invalid and ignored -> vetoes(m1) = 0 < 1 -> nothing is disqualified and all three finalists survive. Round robin: m1 beats m2 4-0, m1 beats m3 4-0, m2 beats m3 3-1; Copeland m1 = 2, m2 = 1, m3 = 0 -> Condorcet winner m1. Counting u5's veto would disqualify m1, leave {m2,m3} = 2 survivors (so the exception would not rescue it) and hand the win to m2 instead.",
